{{ModBox}}
'''{{BASEPAGENAME}}''' is a [[Companion]] [[mod]] that adds damage and {{D|Void}} damage to the companion for 10 seconds when dealing damage with an [[Amp]]. In return, when the companion deals {{D|Void}} damage, Amp and [[Transference]] efficiency is granted for 5 seconds.

