==Acquisition==
The mod can be bought from [[The Business]] for {{sc|20,000}} after reaching '''Rank 3 - Doer''' with [[Solaris United]].

==Notes==
*Can be triggered by damage dealt with [[Void Sling]].
*The added {{D|Void}} damage to the Companion's weapon allows {{M|Manifold Bond}} to proc Void status on their Precept mods.
*Stacks with other sources of amp ammo efficiency, such as the amp arcane [[Eternal Logistics]]. Combining the two allows the amp to gain 100% ammo efficiency, granting it infinite ammo.
*Unlike {{A|Xata's Whisper}} it allows companions to deal damage to Eidolon shields and kill [[Thrax Centurion]]'s and [[Thrax Legatus]]' spectral forms.

